FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM golang:1.27.2-alpine@sha256:f92b6ef800e499660581efdabdf25d9d817a9d124eaf900924f0504e7e27e12d AS builder

ARG TARGETOS=linux
ARG TARGETARCH=amd64
ARG VERSION=dev

WORKDIR /src
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download

COPY . .
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=$TARGETOS GOARCH=$TARGETARCH \
    go build -trimpath \
    -ldflags="-s -w -X main.version=${VERSION}" \
    -o /out/lepro-bridge \
    ./cmd/lepro-bridge

FROM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot@sha256:afa5c872c891853ca7fcf1f12c3edb23f7eeef36189728842dd51042ff57f7ab

COPY --from=builder /out/lepro-bridge /lepro-bridge
USER nonroot:nonroot
ENTRYPOINT ["/lepro-bridge"]
